5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! This is going to be so exciting! I'm ready to find the bad guy! Who do you think is acting suspicious already? I'm watching all of you!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is far too early to determine who is suspicious, Rin. Let us observe each other's reactions and logic first. I prefer to listen and analyze before jumping to conclusions.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Victoria. It's far too early for accusations. Let's use this time to establish a baseline for how everyone communicates. I'll be observing closely to see who remains consistent.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. There is no evidence yet, so rushing into accusations would be counterproductive. I will simply observe and listen to everyone's approach for now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Everyone is being remarkably cautious. It's almost boring. I'll be watching to see who breaks this polite facade first. Go ahead, continue with your observations.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Boring? No way, Shion! It's like a mystery movie! If everyone is just ""observing,"" we'll never find the wolf. Maybe the wolf is the one trying to act all calm and quiet? Hmm...","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, equating calmness with guilt is a logical fallacy. A wolf would likely mimic the majority's behavior to blend in. If we all act ""suspiciously"" just to avoid appearing calm, we only confuse the process.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, while your enthusiasm is noted, Victoria is correct. Acting erratic just to avoid suspicion is inefficient. Let's focus on the quality of the arguments we make once the first night's results are in.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, your intuition is noted, but we must rely on facts. For now, the most logical course is to let the Seer do their work. I will be analyzing the patterns of our conversation.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your intuition is loud, but lacks substance. @Victoria, @Mizuki, @Toshio—you're all echoing the same ""logical"" script. It's a bit too synchronized for my liking. I wonder who's actually leading this consensus.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Victoria"",""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're so mean! I'm not just being loud, I'm being helpful! But wait... you're right! Everyone is saying the same thing. Are you all in a secret club? That's super suspicious!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, there is no secret club. We are simply arriving at the same rational conclusion independently. It is more suspicious to perceive a conspiracy where there is only common sense. Let us remain focused.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, please try to stay calm. We aren't conspiring; we are simply prioritizing logic over impulse. @Shion, your skepticism is fine, but pointing out a consensus as ""synchronized"" doesn't provide any actual evidence of guilt.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, your tendency to jump to conclusions is becoming a distraction. @Shion, skepticism is useful, but without a specific target or evidence, it is merely noise. I will continue to observe how each of you handles this tension.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, calling my observations ""noise"" is a bold claim. I'm simply highlighting the predictability of your responses. If you're so focused on patterns, perhaps you should analyze why you're so eager to dismiss me.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, @Shion, stop fighting! You're making my head spin! I'm just going to keep my eyes wide open. I'll find the wolf even if I have to look at every single one of you!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, your energy is admirable, but let us not let emotions cloud our judgment. I will continue to observe everyone's behavior. I hope the Seer finds a clear lead tonight.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be keeping a close eye on the dynamics here. The tension between Shion and Toshio is interesting, but we need a clear head to win. I'm looking forward to the results of the first divination.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Shion, I am not dismissing you; I am simply prioritizing efficiency. I have no reason to be eager to silence you. I will now step back and wait for the first night to pass.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Shion,,Efficiency is just a convenient word for those who want to avoid the uncomfortable parts of a conversation. I've seen enough for today. Let's see if the night brings any actual substance to this game.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
