68,2,1,talk,Rin,,Oh no! Toshio is gone! I told you he was acting weird! But wait... someone attacked Mizuki too! That's so scary! Who would do that? Was it the wolf trying to hide the Seer's secrets?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, it is highly probable that the werewolf attacked Mizuki because she claimed the Seer role. Eliminating the Seer is the most logical move for the wolf to prevent further divinations. This suggests Mizuki was likely telling the truth.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, your logic is sound. The wolf wouldn't waste an attack on a fake Seer unless they were trying to frame someone else, but killing the claim immediately is the classic move to blind the village. It seems Mizuki was genuine.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If Mizuki was the real Seer, then the wolf is super mean for taking her away! Now we're all blind! @Victoria, @Shion, since you both think she was real, who do you think the wolf is now? I'm scared!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Victoria"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, fear is not helpful. Since Mizuki cleared Shion, and we have no other confirmed humans, the wolf must be either you or Shion—wait, no, Shion is cleared. That leaves you or me. However, I have been consistent.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, your deduction is a bit too hasty. You've conveniently narrowed it down to yourself and Rin. But don't forget the Possessed. They're the ghost in the machine, hiding as human while the wolf does the dirty work.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're making it sound so complicated! A ghost in the machine? I don't like that! @Victoria, how can you say it's me or you? I'm just a little girl! You're the one acting all fancy and smart!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, being ""fancy and smart"" is not a crime, nor is it evidence of guilt. I am simply applying the facts we have. If Shion is human, the wolf is among the remaining three. We must be objective.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, your ""objectivity"" is starting to feel like a shield. You're pushing the suspicion toward Rin, who is an easy target. Tell me, if you're so certain of the facts, why are you so eager to narrow the field?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're being so scary! Why are you fighting with Victoria now? I'm not an easy target, I'm just Rin! I think you're trying to confuse us so the wolf can win! I'm voting for you!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, please stop. Voting for Shion now would be irrational, as Mizuki's death strongly suggests Shion's clearance was legitimate. We must not waste our final vote on a confirmed human. Let us think carefully.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your panic is as predictable as it is useless. @Victoria, you're playing the role of the rational protector quite well, but that's exactly how a Possessed would ensure the wolf's victory. I'll be voting for you.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
